            ['question' => 'How do I rate content?',                         'answer' => 'On any media item page, you\'ll find a 5-star rating system and thumbs up/down buttons. Simply click your rating while logged in. Your ratings help surface the best content for other fans and contribute to our popularity rankings.',                                                                                    'category' => 'features',    'keywords' => ['rate','rating','stars','review','thumbs up']],
